 "remarks": "Fantastic rental in one of Brookside's most convenient cul-de-sac neighborhoods! Set high on a beautifully landscaped corner lot, this 3 bed/2.5 bath home offers generous living spaces inside and out. The main level features a spacious living room with large windows over looking the expansive front lawn, formal dining room, and large kitchen with access to a screened porch with backyard views. An oversized primary en-suite offers plenty of room for a sitting area or home office, while a second bedroom and full bath complete the main level. The expansive walk-out lower level provides even more flexibility with a third bedroom, half bath, laundry, second enclosed patio and direct garage access. Outside, enjoy professionally landscaped grounds, generous front and backyards, a storage shed, expansive Belgian block-lined driveway, and oversized two-car attached garage. Located in a quiet, tree-lined neighborhood with sidewalks and two cul-de-sacs! Just 3 minutes to the Rowayton train station, 4 minutes to Wegmans and Costco, and 5 minutes to Brookside Elementary and Brien McMahon High School. Central air, automatic generator, city water, and city sewer complete the package!",
